  "substantiveCorrections": [
    {
      "id": "v2-ans4.7-14-second-auxiliary-W",
      "section": "4.7答案14第二辅助算法翻倍式",
      "cnPrintedPage": 568,
      "enPdfPage": 737,
      "enPrintedPage": 722,
      "original": "(n+hat W(z))hat U(z)+z hat U′(z)=R(z)+O(z^n)",
      "final": "(n+W(z))hat U(z)+z hat U′(z)=R(z)+O(z^n)",
      "basis": "两版共同从前一个辅助算法误带hat W记号。此算法给定W且仅定义hat U，代入U_low+z^n hat U至WU+zU′，修正项严格为z^n((W+n)hat U+z hat U′)。所以应使用原给定W，不能使用前一算法的hat W。"
    },
    {
      "id": "v2-ans4.7-15-iteration-power",
      "section": "4.7答案15 U^[n]分母",
      "cnPrintedPage": 568,
      "enPdfPage": 737,
      "enPrintedPage": 722,
      "original": "z/(1+cn z^(1−k))^(1/(k−1))",
      "final": "z/(1+cn z^(k−1))^(1/(k−1))",
      "basis": "两版共同幂符号倒置。由同段正确微分方程积分，U(z)^(1−k)=z^(1−k)+c，提取z^(1−k)得到U=z(1+c z^(k−1))^(−1/(k−1))。在迭代中平移常数c相加为nc，给修复式；原式不再以z为首项，不能是所需形式幂级数。"
    }
  ],
